@title S2 EP 01 • PLAY HARD
@bg soccer_pitch_night
Season 2. Same campus. Different team. You're Sasha Reed, sophomore transfer, center mid. You've been at Maple Valley for nine hours and the soccer team already has a group chat about you.
@show nicole
Nicole: Captain's meeting. Two rules. One: we don't lose. Two: whatever happens in this locker room—
@show jordan
Jordan: —ends up on Maya's phone by midnight. Let's be honest.
Nicole: Say that louder, Ellis.
Jordan: I said it at a normal volume. You just hate hearing it.
@show brooke
Brooke walks in late wearing a basketball jacket that is very clearly not hers. Jordan's whole face changes.
Jordan: Whose jacket, Brooke?
Brooke: Mine. Now.
Jordan: We broke up FOUR DAYS AGO.
Brooke: Four days is a long time, babe.
Everyone turns to look at you, the new girl, like you're supposed to referee.
> [Sweet] "Hi! I'm Sasha. I bring snacks and good vibes." -> a1
> [Bitchy] "Do y'all always fight in front of guests or is this for me?" -> a2
> [Bold] "That jacket is ugly anyway, Brooke." -> a3
> [Good] Say nothing. Sit next to the goalie. -> a4
*a1
@add Amara_Friendship 2
@add Nicole_Friendship 1
@show amara
Amara: Oh my God. Snacks AND vibes. Simone, she's sitting with us forever.
@jump a_done
*a2
@add Valentina_Friendship 2
@add Nicole_Friendship -1
@show valentina
Valentina: (cackling) Okay, I'm obsessed. She's mine. Nobody touch her.
@jump a_done
*a3
@add Jordan_Friendship 3
@add Brooke_Friendship -3
@add Drama 1
Jordan laughs so hard she has to sit down. Brooke smiles at you like a shark smiles at a seal.
Brooke: Noted, new girl. Noted.
@jump a_done
*a4
@add Chloe_Friendship 2
@show chloe
Chloe: (not looking up from her gloves) Smart. The last transfer picked a side on day one. She plays club in Ohio now.
*a_done
@bg locker_room_night
@show maya
Maya slides next to you while everyone's changing.
Maya: Welcome gift. (shows her phone) That's Tyler from basketball's jacket. That's Tyler picking Brooke up Saturday. That's Tyler's ex, who is a SWIMMER, who Amara has a crush on. It's all connected. It's beautiful.
> [Bad] "Airdrop me all of it." -> m1
> [Good] "Keep me out of it." -> m2
> [Bitchy] "You need a hobby, Maya." -> m3
> [Bold] Walk over and show Jordan. -> m4
