@show riley
Riley: (popping up behind you, smelling like a bonfire) Okay new girl. Party at the lake house Friday. Nobody tells Coach. Nobody tells Nia. Especially nobody tells Nia.
@show nia
Nia: I'm standing right here, Riley.
Riley: And yet you're not invited. Isn't that crazy?
